  "idea": "Linear vs Jira: why modern engineering teams are ditching Atlassian",
  "text": "The speed difference between Linear's keyboard-first UI and Jira's clunky load times changes everything. Developers lose momentum waiting five seconds for overloaded Jira boards to render. Cluttered permission trees and bloated enterprise schemas turn simple issue updates into painful friction. Linear utilizes localized caching and universal command shortcuts that let developers triage tasks in milliseconds. This protects developer focus while speeding up releases.",
